# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATED ARTIFACTS -- every one of these is rebuilt by the scripts.
#
# They were tracked until 2026-08-11. Five rebuilds of the 27 MB workbook in a
# single session took .git from 76 MB to 223 MB, because git stores a whole new
# copy of a binary on every change. History was rewritten to purge them; keep
# them out.
#
# Rebuild order:  fetch_sec_fundamentals.py -> fetch_prices.py ->
#                 fetch_sic.py -> score_companies.py -> build_excel.py
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xlsx
!Picks/*.xlsx
